<title>USA: Princeton National Bancorp Q3 net drops.</title>
<headline>Princeton National Bancorp Q3 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, Illinois 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.23   profit	 $0.30</p>
<p> Net profit		   624   profit	   808</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.89     loss	 $0.19</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,433     loss	   521</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said net income for the 1996 quarter was negatively impacted by a charge of $217,614 or $0.08 (after tax) as a result of the enactment of a recent bill mandating special one-time payment.</p>
